# AI Agent

See also: `docs/015_AI_AGENT.md`

## Role

`ai_agent` assists humans — never silently commit binding commercial actions.

## v1 capabilities

- Supplier / SKU matching from natural language
- RFQ draft generation
- Landed-cost estimation heuristics
- HS hints with mandatory human review later

## Implementation points

- UI: `/ai` · `frontend/features/ai/AiAssistantPanel.tsx`
- API (planned): `POST /api/ai/procurement`
- Prefer tool-calling orchestration over one-shot ungrounded answers
- Cite matched SKUs / RFQ ids in replies

## Safety

- Confirm before create/update RFQ or order
- Rate-limit per user/org
- Redact secrets from prompt logs
- Keep privileged model calls server-side / Edge Functions

## Stack

OpenAI chat + embeddings/vector search; OCR/translation/recommendations in later phases.
